WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.330
Bird was in her nest.

2
00:00:09.331 --> 00:00:19.081
She was looking at something.

3
00:00:19.082 --> 00:00:22.915
"What are you doing, Bird?" asked Kip.

4
00:00:22.916 --> 00:00:29.125
"I'm looking at my stamp collection," said Bird.

5
00:00:29.126 --> 00:00:33.120
"I didn't know you like stamps," said Kip.

6
00:00:33.121 --> 00:00:44.039
"Yes, I like stamps a lot," said Bird.

7
00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:53.679
"Some of these are pretty dusty," said Bird.

8
00:00:53.680 --> 00:01:01.182
"I haven't looked at them in a while."

9
00:01:01.183 --> 00:01:08.952
"They have nice colors," said Kip.

10
00:01:08.953 --> 00:01:15.445
"And they have neat pictures."

11
00:01:15.446 --> 00:01:21.770
"Cool! An airplane," said Kip.

12
00:01:21.771 --> 00:01:26.629
"Here's one with a moon," said Bird.

13
00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:34.608
"I like these turtles," said Kip.

14
00:01:34.609 --> 00:01:41.565
"Hey, look! I see a chipmunk!"

15
00:01:41.566 --> 00:01:49.216
"This stamp is my favorite," said Bird.

16
00:01:49.217 --> 00:01:55.712
"It has a bird.

17
00:01:55.713 --> 00:02:05.125
Doesn't it look just like me?"

18
00:02:05.126 --> 00:02:07.795
"Yes, Bird" said Kip.

19
00:02:07.796 --> 00:02:11.448
"That bird does look like . . .

20
00:02:11.449 --> 00:02:20.529
Ah . . . ah . . . ah-choo!"

